`MemoryI18nPlugin` is now duplicated (root `objectstack.config.ts` and `apps/console/objectstack.config.ts`) with identical logic/name/version. This increases the chance the two configs drift over time. Consider extracting a shared helper (e.g. a small local module) or at least importing the same implementation from one place so future i18n service changes only need to be made once.
```suggestion
function registerMemoryI18nService(ctx: any) {
  const svc = createMemoryI18n();
  ctx.registerService('i18n', svc);
}

class MemoryI18nPlugin {
  readonly name = 'com.objectstack.service.i18n';
  readonly version = '1.0.0';
  readonly type = 'service' as const;

  init(ctx: any) {
    registerMemoryI18nService(ctx);
```
